      "rationale": "Measure conflicts between excluded neighbors and surviving actions explicitly. Rewarding this released burden may distinguish equal local neighborhoods, with neighbor packing capacity balancing the cost of exclusion."
    },
    {
      "name": "weighted_conflict_moments",
